## 2. Test inspection: left vs right

Inspected `novacore/tests/test_prompts.py`: `test_prompt_and_catalogue_are_consistent`:
- Left: `name.lower()` where `name` originates from `CATALOGUE` in `novacore.capabilities`.
- Right: `mentioned`, extracted via regex `r'\b[a-z_]+\.[a-z_]+\b'` from `SYSTEM_PROMPT` in `novacore.prompts`.
The two sides originate from independent sources (`capabilities.py` vs `prompts.py`). When an unmentioned confirmation-required capability was added in W4 probe 1, the test caught the discrepancy and failed with an `AssertionError`.

